        <item>
            <title>0.10.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 22:24:38 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- You can see duplicate, shadowed and overlapping rules directly in the overview.
- You can compare related rules together, even when they are far apart in the list. Afterwards, you return to your previous scroll position.
- You see hints about existing active rules in the link dialog, regardless of the browser you select. You can still create and run a new rule or view the existing rules in the overview.
- Your first click on an unselected app rule now selects it without immediately opening the app picker. Another click on the name opens the app picker.
- You now see a hint when a domain entry is invalid. Domain rules require at least one dot and only apply when the entry is valid.
]]></description>
